00:31:43.230 --> 00:31:55.910
One thing that we discovered, I think recently, probably before we even, after we booked you to come on, Rob, is this episode, and Doug, I'm going to throw it to a clip here.
我想最近我们发现的一件事，可能是在我们预订你上场之后，罗布，这一集，道格，我要把它放到这里的一个剪辑中。

00:31:55.910 --> 00:32:20.589
This episode was selected when we, a variety did a piece when we hit 20 years, 20 years since the pilot, which was in September, variety did a piece where they did the top 20 episodes, the top 20 funniest or most beloved episodes, according to this one writer, Andrew McGowan, And he chose this one as his top, because it exhibited, I guess, the platonic ideal of what how much mother episode was to him.
这一集是在我们 20 周年的时候选择的，自试播集 20 年后，也就是 9 月份，综艺节目做了一个节目，他们做了前 20 集，前 20 名最有趣或最受欢迎的剧集，根据这位作家安德鲁·麦高恩的说法，他选择这一集作为他的最佳剧集，我猜，因为它展示了柏拉图式的理想，即母亲的剧集对他来说有多重要。

00:32:20.589 --> 00:32:29.509
And that may or may not be my pen name, but yeah, we've never met Andrew again, exactly.
这可能是也可能不是我的笔名，但是，是的，我们再也没有见过安德鲁，确切地说。

00:32:29.509 --> 00:32:30.509
And we have a clip.
我们有一个剪辑。

00:32:30.509 --> 00:32:31.509
Here is Andrew McGowan.
请听安德鲁·麦高恩的报道。

00:32:31.509 --> 00:32:33.549
Let's decide if it sounds like Rob doing a voice.
让我们判断一下这听起来是否像 Rob 的声音。

00:32:33.549 --> 00:32:36.430
I don't think it will, but there's always that chance.
我认为不会，但机会总是有的。

00:32:36.430 --> 00:32:37.430
We have a clip.
我们有一个剪辑。

00:32:37.430 --> 00:32:44.390
heard we were doing this, and he wanted to weigh in and explain why he selected it as his top choice.
听说我们正在这样做，他想参与进来并解释为什么他选择它作为他的首选。

00:32:44.390 --> 00:32:47.881
So let's listen to Variety writer, Andrew McGowan.
让我们来听听《综艺》杂志撰稿人安德鲁·麦高恩的看法。

00:32:47.881 --> 00:32:48.579
Hi, Craig.
嗨，克雷格。

00:32:48.579 --> 00:32:49.208
Hi, Josh.
嗨，乔什。

00:32:49.208 --> 00:32:50.744
Hi, Alec, and hi, Rob.
嗨，亚历克，嗨，罗布。

00:32:50.744 --> 00:32:56.470
A belated congratulations on 20 years since the premiere of How I Met Your Mother.
迟来的祝贺《老爸老妈的浪漫史》首映 20 周年。

00:32:57.029 --> 00:33:04.322
For the milestone anniversary, I had the pleasure of revisiting the show and ranking the top 20 episodes for a variety.
为了纪念这一里程碑式的周年纪念日，我有幸重温了该剧，并对各种综艺节目的前 20 集进行了排名。

00:33:04.322 --> 00:33:12.963
The criteria was not an exact science, but I broadly weighed each episode based on its writing, direction, premise, humor, heart and message.
标准并不是一门精确的科学，但我根据每一集的写作、方向、前提、幽默、内心和信息对每一集进行了广泛的权衡。

00:33:12.963 --> 00:33:21.604
While there were many episodes that pained me not to include on the list, I think that I always knew that Monday Night Football would top it.
虽然有很多剧集让我很痛苦，但我想我一直都知道周一橄榄球之夜会名列前茅。

00:33:21.604 --> 00:33:25.832
The episode, I believe, epitomizes how I met your mother at its best.
我相信，这一集集中体现了我如何遇见你母亲最好的一面。

00:33:25.832 --> 00:33:32.390
It's sort of a timeless episode, one that a seasoned fan of the show and a newcomer can appreciate equally.
这是一部永恒的剧集，经验丰富的剧迷和新人都可以同样欣赏。

00:33:32.390 --> 00:33:42.230
The premise is relatable, not just of friends watching the Super Bowl together, but of friends trying to share a common experience and keep a tradition alive against the odds.
这个前提是相关的，不仅是朋友们一起观看超级碗，而且是朋友们试图分享共同的经历并在困难中保持传统。

00:33:42.869 --> 00:33:53.910
And in facing those odds, we get to see each of the characters showcase some of their most quintessential qualities across this one main A story that splinters in four different ways.
面对这些困难，我们看到每个角色在这个以四种不同方式分裂的主要故事中展示了他们最典型的品质。

00:33:55.029 --> 00:34:07.700
Barney's emotional zanniness and unhinged mystery is shown through his gambling addiction, Robin's unglamorous life as a local newscaster is seen and how unprofessional she can get away with acting on air.
巴尼的赌博成瘾展现了他情感上的热情和精神错乱的神秘感，罗宾作为当地新闻播音员的平淡生活以及她在广播中的表演是多么不专业。

00:34:07.700 --> 00:34:19.382
Marshall's conflict with the five-year-old in Lily's class shows his boyish endearing demeanor and Ted's innovation and excitement with the sensory depurator 5,000 brings out his geekiness.
马歇尔与莉莉班上五岁孩子的冲突显示了他孩子气的讨人喜欢的举止，而泰德对感官净化器 5,000 的创新和兴奋则凸显了他的极客气质。

00:34:19.382 --> 00:34:34.587
But of course it's the end of the episode that I believe elevated above the rest, how they all fail to evade the score of the game, but still walk the game together and realize that it's the time spent together that brings value to the tradition.
当然，我认为这一集的结尾比其他部分更重要，他们都未能逃避游戏的得分，但仍然一起走完游戏，并意识到正是在一起度过的时间为传统带来了价值。

00:34:34.587 --> 00:34:45.590
When Future Ted narrates that all these years later, he can't remember who won or who even played the game, but he remembers eating wings, laughing, hanging out with his friends.
多年后，当未来的泰德讲述这件事时，他不记得谁赢了，甚至不记得谁玩了这个游戏，但他记得吃鸡翅、大笑、和朋友们一起出去玩。

00:34:45.590 --> 00:34:52.863
I think that really encapsulates the show's broader meaning, more so than the engine of Ted meeting the mother.
我认为这确实概括了该剧更广泛的意义，比泰德遇见母亲的引擎更重要。

00:34:52.863 --> 00:34:56.401
How I met your mother, I believe, is about friendship.
我相信我是因为友谊才认识你母亲的。

00:34:56.401 --> 00:35:09.113
It's about a time in one's young adulthood when friends serve as family and the most important memories are not necessarily defined by the headline events, but rather by who you share them with.
这是关于一个人年轻时的一段时光，那时朋友就像家人一样，最重要的记忆不一定是由头条新闻定义的，而是由你与谁分享的。

00:35:09.113 --> 00:35:13.568
So that's why I ranked Monday Night Football at the top of the list.
这就是为什么我将《周一橄榄球之夜》排在了榜首。

00:35:13.568 --> 00:35:20.448
Thank you all so much for creating this wonderful series that means so much to me and so much to so many.
非常感谢大家创作了这个精彩的系列，这对我和很多人来说意义重大。

00:35:20.448 --> 00:35:27.394
Overall, there is so much to learn from appreciate and empathize with over the course of the nine seasons.
总的来说，在这九季的过程中，有很多值得学习、欣赏和同情的地方。

00:35:27.394 --> 00:35:30.801
And it will always hold a special place in my heart.
它永远在我心中占有特殊的位置。

00:35:30.801 --> 00:35:33.750
So thank you again and congratulations again.
再次感谢并祝贺。

00:35:33.750 --> 00:35:36.370
Craig, I hope to catch up with you soon.
克雷格，我希望很快就能找到你。

00:35:36.370 --> 00:35:40.630
